msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Thai (ไทย) locale bundle."
msgstr "थाई (ไทย) लोकलाइज़ेशन बंडल."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/toggleButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-toggle-button>` — a two-state button. `pressed=\"true\"` reflects to the button's\n`aria-pressed`; slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-toggle-button&gt;` — a two-state button. `pressed=\"true\"` reflects to the button's\n`aria-pressed`; slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/toggleButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bookmarked"
msgstr "बुकमार्क किया गया"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tooltip>` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble (from the `tip` attribute)\non hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` and\n`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. JS owns the timing:\na `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/`:focus-within` auto-show\nso the delay actually applies."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tooltip&gt;` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble (from the `tip` attribute)\non hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` and\n`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. JS owns the timing:\na `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/`:focus-within` auto-show\nso the delay actually applies."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hover me"
msgstr "मुझ पर होवर करें"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tr.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Turkish (Türkçe) locale bundle."
msgstr "तुर्की (Türkçe) लोकलाइज़ेशन बंडल."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tray>` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-<value>`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tray&gt;` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-&lt;value&gt;`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "मेनू"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/treeBrowser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tree-browser>` — the styled shell of a collapsible tree, with `role=\"tree\"`. The consumer\nslots the tree markup."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tree-browser&gt;` — the styled shell of a collapsible tree, with `role=\"tree\"`. The consumer\nslots the tree markup."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-truncate>` — clamps slotted text to a fixed number of lines with an ellipsis. `lines`\naccepts a positive integer or `auto`. A number sets the `--lines` custom property directly.\n`auto` computes a line count from the host's available height and applies that as `--lines`.\nOmit `lines` for single-line truncation."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-truncate&gt;` — clamps slotted text to a fixed number of lines with an ellipsis. `lines`\naccepts a positive integer or `auto`. A number sets the `--lines` custom property directly.\n`auto` computes a line count from the host's available height and applies that as `--lines`.\nOmit `lines` for single-line truncation."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A long description that will be clamped to two lines…"
msgstr "एक लंबा विवरण जो दो पंक्तियों तक सीमा में काट दिया जाएगा…"

